\title{Möbius transformation}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2026-11-24}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{A \em{Möbius transformation} (or \em{map}) is a function of a complex variable #{z} that can be written in the form}

##{f(z) = \frac{az + b}{cz + d}}

\p{for some #{a, b, c, d \in \mathbb{C}} with #{ad - bc \neq 0}.}
